items.Arrakis_Blood_Extractor.name = Blood Extractor
items.Arrakis_Blood_Extractor.description = An off-hand tool. Place it in a utility slot, pick it with Z, and hold the right mouse button to hold it out in front of you.
items.Arrakis_Dew_Reaper.name = Dew Reaper
items.Arrakis_Dew_Reaper.description = An off-hand tool. Place it in a utility slot, pick it with Z, and click the right mouse button for a slow swing.
items.Arrakis_Compactor.name = Compactor
items.Arrakis_Compactor.description = An off-hand tool. Place it in a utility slot, pick it with Z, and hold the right mouse button to point it where you look. Aimed at sand within 3 blocks it compacts it: the block cracks, then gives one drop and heals, again and again, and is never broken. It costs Arrakis power.
items.Arrakis_Cutter_Ray.name = Cutter Ray
items.Arrakis_Cutter_Ray.description = A two-handed tool. Hold the left mouse button for a beam that cuts the block you are looking at, up to 5 blocks away. Costs 1 power per second.
commands.arrakis.desc = Debug commands for the equipment of Arrakis: arrakis power fill|set <n> [player] (operators only)
commands.arrakis.power.desc = Debug commands for the Arrakis_Power stat: arrakis power fill|set <n> [player]
commands.arrakis.power.fill.desc = Fill power to its maximum: arrakis power fill [player]
commands.arrakis.power.set.desc = Set power (0-100): arrakis power set <n> [player]
commands.arrakis.laser.desc = Debug commands for the laser line: arrakis laser spawn [keep] | count
commands.arrakis.laser.spawn.desc = Add one laser segment at 0 100 0 (keep: owned, so it stays): arrakis laser spawn [keep]
commands.arrakis.laser.count.desc = Count the laser segments and all entities: arrakis laser count
commands.arrakis.laser.rig.desc = Add three test rods ahead of you to see which way a laser piece lies: arrakis laser rig
commands.arrakis.laser.clear.desc = Remove the test rods: arrakis laser clear
commands.arrakis.laser.rig.desc = Add three test rods ahead of you to see which way a laser piece lies: arrakis laser rig
commands.arrakis.laser.clear.desc = Remove the test rods: arrakis laser clear
items.Arrakis_Cutter_Ray_Mk2.name = Cutter Ray Mk2
items.Arrakis_Cutter_Ray_Mk2.description = A two-handed pulse rifle. Hold the left mouse button to fire at a block up to 5 blocks away: each shot chips the block and throws sparks and white globs. Costs 1 power per second. Does not hurt creatures.
commands.arrakis.compactor.desc = Compactor development commands.
commands.arrakis.compactor.selftest.desc = Runs the Compactor engine calls on a sand block placed at 0, 200, 0 and reports.
